OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for antisocial behaviour
OL,4,Afines in town centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council wants to implement powers to
OL,7,Fissue on-the-spot fines for antisocial
OL,8,Fbehaviour in seven town centres.
OL,10,FDurham County Council is considering
OL,11,Fimplementing Public Space Protection
OL,12,FOrders (PSPOs) in Bishop Auckland,
OL,13,FChester-le-Street, Consett, Durham
OL,14,FCity, Peterlee, Seaham and Stanley.
OL,16,FThe measure would give police and
OL,17,Fcouncil officers powers to issue fines
OL,18,For remove people from an area for
OL,19,Fproblems including intimidating
OL,20,Fbehaviour, alcohol and substance misuse
OL,21,Fand nuisance electric bikes and
OL,22,Fscooters.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
