OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for antisocial behaviour
OL,4,Afines in town centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Reform-led authority said proposals
OL,7,Fwould include measures against wearing
OL,8,Fface coverings such as balaclavas "to
OL,9,Fconceal a person's identity while
OL,10,Fcommitting antisocial behaviour."
